#: a4be4356869241c5950537edad0923b0
msgid "Using Jittor as PyTorch (`import jittor as torch`)"
msgstr "将计图作为 PyTorch 使用（`import jittor as torch`）"

#: 6f158f62933641f59eddd04307ac6c54
msgid ""
"Jittor ships a torch-compatibility layer so PyTorch code — including "
"**transformers**, **PEFT**, **accelerate**, and **LlamaFactory** — runs "
"**unmodified** on Jittor, on both **NVIDIA GPUs (CUDA/NCCL)** and "
"**Huawei Ascend NPUs (ACL/HCCL)**. You only change the import:"
msgstr ""

#: 8a7acd45775f4c498d7923b3e6e039b3
msgid ""
"The torch-style API lives in the canonical `jittor.compat.torch` package "
"and is installed onto the Jittor module at import. `jittor.compat.shim` "
"re-exports it as the `torch` package so third-party libraries' internal "
"`import torch` works too. Deploy that shim into the active environment "
"with:"
msgstr ""

